<metadata preset-name="One-Finger Wall" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="Every note on the low and middle strings becomes a square-wave power chord (root and fifth), pushed with the guitar into a cranked British 120-watt head. Synth and string distort together: a one-finger riff lands like a full stack playing fifths, a strum like a wall. Interval goes from octaves to sus4." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
